{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mega Deal Card</strong> combines the depth of deckbuilders with the tension of gambling games. In this roguelite, your goal is simple: place cards on a 3x3 board to combine shapes and symbols and earn the points needed to clear the level. But be careful: with each victory, the challenge rises and shop prices skyrocket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Board</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The board is your laboratory of synergies. Every card you place has the potential to trigger devastating combos.<br>\u2022 <strong>Generate Chips:</strong> Create combinations to earn in-game currency.<br>\u2022 <strong>Invest Wisely:</strong> Use your chips to buy card packs and unique Special Cards.<br>\u2022 <strong>Critical Management:</strong> If you fail to control your economy, rising pack prices will push you out of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854730/extras/8f0db27efdc3205319bc0a82d7151d2b.poster.avif?t=1769104743\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854730/extras/8f0db27efdc3205319bc0a82d7151d2b.webm?t=1769104743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854730/extras/8f0db27efdc3205319bc0a82d7151d2b.mp4?t=1769104743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tools to tip the balance in your favor:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Special Cards:</strong> Powerful boosters with 6 rarity levels. Take risks to activate massive multipliers, modify cards, or even\u00a0 the board slots themselves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854730/extras/959d1610c337dbfae24d4050d98ce58b.poster.avif?t=1769104743\" width=1170 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854730/extras/959d1610c337dbfae24d4050d98ce58b.webm?t=1769104743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854730/extras/959d1610c337dbfae24d4050d98ce58b.mp4?t=1769104743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2022 <strong>Deals:</strong> Modifiers that define your playstyle. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854730/extras/2c8d7eb8f4c5617c7b615bd1b5e2c7f8.poster.avif?t=1769104743\" width=1024 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854730/extras/2c8d7eb8f4c5617c7b615bd1b5e2c7f8.webm?t=1769104743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854730/extras/2c8d7eb8f4c5617c7b615bd1b5e2c7f8.mp4?t=1769104743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u2022 <strong>Decks:</strong> Each deck is a new strategy. Which one will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854730/extras/5618369ea0ece9a7ae8d34d3efa47f96.poster.avif?t=1769104743\" width=1170 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854730/extras/5618369ea0ece9a7ae8d34d3efa47f96.webm?t=1769104743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854730/extras/5618369ea0ece9a7ae8d34d3efa47f96.mp4?t=1769104743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Mega Deal Board:</strong> Alter your cards to make them fit your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854730/extras/798312318a3e1c67e66cb8641489c87b.poster.avif?t=1769104743\" width=800 height=530 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854730/extras/798312318a3e1c67e66cb8641489c87b.webm?t=1769104743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854730/extras/798312318a3e1c67e66cb8641489c87b.mp4?t=1769104743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Exponential Scaling:</strong> Designed to reach astronomical scores through multiplicative combos that defy logic.<br>\u2022 <strong>Risk and Reward Loop:</strong> Overcome increasingly demanding levels where managing your chips is just as important as the cards you play.<br>\u2022 <strong>Permanent Progression:</strong> Complete achievements to unlock new Special Cards, Deals, and Decks that expand the possibilities of every run.<br>\u2022 <strong>Endless Mode:</strong> Push beyond the game\u2019s limits. How long can you survive against ever-increasing difficulty?<br>\u2022 <strong>Unstoppable Synergies:</strong> Discover hidden interactions between Special Cards and Deals to break the system and dominate the game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854730?t=1769104743","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storep